<title>USA: Equifax sees double-digit growth in Q4, yr.</title>
<headline>Equifax sees double-digit growth in Q4, yr.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equifax Inc said on Tuesday that it expects double-digit earnings and revenue growth in the fourth quarter of 1996 and full year.</p>
<p>The company said that it expects 1996 to become another record financial year from international expansion, the development of new technology-based products and acquisitions.</p>
